<div id="alert-dialog-overview">
    <h1>Alert Dialog Component</h1>
    
    <p>
        The alert dialog pattern is a type of <a href="/component/lightbox-dialog">lightbox dialog</a> that displays a critical message. The alert must be explicitly acknowledged in order to dismiss it and proceed.
    </p>
    
    <p>
        The behaviour is similar to the JavaScript <code>window.alert()</code> method.
    </p>
</div>
